PYTHON-LAB-EXPERIMENT-1.1
Aim
To write a Python program to demonstrate different types of data types such as Integer, Float, String, Boolean, List, Set, and Tuple.

Algorithm
1.Start the program.

2.Initialize a variable with a String value.

3.Initialize a variable with an Integer value.

4.Initialize a variable with a Float value.

5.Perform a comparison operation to demonstrate the Boolean data type.

6.Initialize a variable with multiple values using a List.

7.Initialize a variable with multiple unique values using a Set.

8.Initialize a variable with multiple values using a Tuple.

9.Display the values of all the data types.

10.Stop the program.



